ꦥꦿꦺꦴꦒꦿꦩ꧀ Main;
ꦒꦸꦤꦏꦏꦺ error, lexer, vm, parser, codegen;

ꦩꦸꦭꦶ
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ JumlahParam() >= 1 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    namaFile := Param(1)
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    namaFile := 'contoh/01_hello.jkf';
  kode := BacaFile(namaFile);
  panjang := Panjang(kode);
  i := 1;
  baris := 1;
  kolom := 1;
  adaError := 0;
  varSimpan := '';
  NextToken;
  ExecStmt;
  ꦪꦺꦤ꧀ adaError = 0 ꦩꦺꦴꦁꦏꦺꦴ
    ꦠꦸꦭꦶꦱ꧀('Selesai, tidak ada error')
  ꦭꦶꦪꦤꦺ
    ꦠꦸꦭꦶꦱ꧀('Program berhenti karena error');
ꦫꦩ꧀ꦥꦸꦁ.